docs {
  # ClassroomService.RecordLevels

  Takes the levels of the latest graded attempts to the official record of the open term

  `/ltedu.classroom.v1.ClassroomService/RecordLevels` · unary · `ltedu/classroom/v1/classroom.proto`

  ## Request — `RecordLevelsRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `item_id` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `RecordLevelsResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `recorded` | `int32` |  |
  | `skipped_student_ids` | `repeated string` | Students left out: their section has no teacher for the area, or its sheet is closed or not yours |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
}
